#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:4
msgid "Creating Cutout Animation"
msgstr "创建剪切动画"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:5
msgid ""
"Cutout animation is based on characters made of several sections connected "
"together to create a character model. For example a basic model can be made of "
"a drawing for the head, one for the body, one for each arm, and one for each "
"leg."
msgstr ""
"剪切动画基于由几个部分连接在一起创建角色模型的角色。例如，一个基本模型可以由头"
"部、身体、每条手臂和每条腿的图形组成。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:7
msgid ""
"Animations in this case can be created not by adding drawings depicting the new "
"animated poses, but by transforming (i.e. moving or rotating) the model "
"sections individually at different frames, in order to create different actions."
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，动画不是通过添加描绘新动画姿势的图形来创建的，而是通过在不同帧处单"
"独变换（即移动或旋转）模型部分来创建的。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:9
msgid "|character_model_sample|"
msgstr "|character_model_sample|"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:11
msgid ""
"In OpenToonz it's possible to create links between a model's different sections "
"and to set pivot points for each one of them, in order to better manage the "
"animation. For example, you can link a hand to an arm at the wrist, and link "
"the arm to the trunk at the shoulder: in this way when you move the trunk, you "
"will move both arm and hand as well; when you move the arm, it will turn around "
"the shoulder and the hand will follow its movement; when you move the hand, it "
"will turn around the wrist."
msgstr ""
"在OpenToonz中，可以在模型的不同部分之间创建链接，并为每个部分设置枢轴点，以便更"
"好地管理动画。例如，你可以将一只手连接到手腕上的手臂，并将手臂连接到肩膀上的躯"
"干：这样，当你移动躯干时，你也会同时移动手臂和手；当你移动手臂时，它会绕着肩膀转"
"动，手也会跟着它的运动；当你移动手时，它会绕手腕转动。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:13
msgid "**To create a cutout animation:**"
msgstr "**要创建剪切动画，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:15
msgid ""
"Place each section (that can be a single drawing or an animated level) of your "
"character in a different column/layer."
msgstr "将角色的每个部分（可以是单个图形或动画级别）放置在不同的列/层中。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:17
msgid ""
"Use the **Skeleton** tool (|skeleton|) to link each section to the other and "
"set the related pivot points."
msgstr ""
"使用**骨架**工具（|Skeleton|）将每个部分链接到另一个部分，并设置相关的枢轴点。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:19
msgid ""
"Create keyframes for each section at different frames to animate the cutout "
"character."
msgstr "在不同帧处为每个部分创建关键帧，以设置剪切角色的动画。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:25
msgid "Using the Skeleton Tool"
msgstr "使用骨架工具"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:26
msgid ""
"The **Skeleton** tool (|skeleton|) allows you to define a model by setting "
"hierarchical links between its different sections exposed in different Xsheet "
"columns (or Timeline layers), and animate it."
msgstr ""
"**骨架**工具（|Skeleton|）允许您通过在不同Xsheet列（或时间线层）中显示的不同部分"
"之间设置层次链接来定义模型，并为其设置动画。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:28
msgid ""
"It basically makes possible, by using a single and more immediate tool, the "
"same tasks that could be achieved by using the Stage Schematic and the "
"**Animate** tool (|animate|), when used to create links and animate the "
"transformations of columns/layers (see :ref:`Linking Objects "
"<linking_objects>`  ). Indeed, any editing performed with the **Skeleton** tool "
"(|skeleton|) can also be seen happening in the Stage Schematic and the columns/"
"layers transformation values, and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"当用于创建链接和设置列/层变换的动画时，它基本上可以通过使用一个更直接的工具来实"
"现与使用Stage Schematic和**Animate**工具（|Animate|）可以实现的任务相同的任务"
"（请参阅：ref:“链接对象<Linking_Objects>”）。事实上，使用**骨架**工具（|"
"Skeleton|）执行的任何编辑也可以在Stage Schematic和列/层转换值中看到，反之亦然。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:30
msgid "In the tool options bar you can set the following:"
msgstr "在工具选项栏中，您可以设置以下内容："

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Mode** sets the operation to perform with the tool. Options are: **Build "
"Skeleton**, to create links between the different sections, **Animate**, to "
"animate the character model, and **Inverse Kinematics**, to animate the "
"character model using inverse kinematics."
msgstr ""
"**模式**设置使用工具执行的操作。选项包括：**构建骨架**，在不同部分之间创建链接；"
"**动画**，为角色模型设置动画；**反向运动学**，使用反向运动学为角色模型创建动画。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Global Key** when activated sets a key for all the object transformations as "
"soon as a key is defined by animating the skeleton. This means that if you "
"rotate a model section, automatically a key will be defined for the position, "
"scaling and shearing transformations as well."
msgstr ""
"**全局关键点**激活后，一旦通过设置骨架动画定义了关键点，就会为所有对象变换设置关"
"键点。这意味着，如果旋转模型截面，也会自动为位置、缩放和剪切变换定义一个关键帧。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Show Only Active Skeleton** when activated displays only the pivot points and "
"the skeleton from the current section up to the parent section: in this way it "
"will be easier to manage characters with skeletons of a higher complexity."
msgstr ""
"**激活时仅显示活动骨架**仅显示从当前部分到父部分的枢轴点和骨架：这样，更容易管理"
"具有更高复杂性骨架的角色。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:42
msgid "Building a Skeleton"
msgstr "构建骨架"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:43
msgid ""
"When the **Skeleton** tool (|skeleton|) mode is set to **Build Skeleton**, it's "
"possible to set pivot points and links between sections by using the handle "
"available in the Viewer."
msgstr ""
"当**骨架**工具（|Skeleton|）模式设置为**构建骨架**时，可以使用查看器中可用的控制"
"柄设置截面之间的枢轴点和链接。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:45
msgid "|handle|"
msgstr "|handle|"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:47
msgid ""
"The handle is made of a small circle, with an arm that by default extends "
"upwards. This allows you to perform the following tasks:"
msgstr "手柄由一个小圆圈组成，默认情况下，手臂向上延伸。这允许您执行以下任务："

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:49
msgid "Click and drag the **yellow circle** to set the pivot point position."
msgstr "单击并拖动**黄色圆圈**以设置枢轴点位置。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:51
msgid ""
"Click and drag the **square** at the end of the extended arm to set the link to "
"another section."
msgstr "单击并拖动延伸臂末端的**正方形**，将链接设置到另一个部分。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:53
msgid ""
"The section pivot point can be moved, but *cannot* change its position during "
"the animation: once it is set, or modified, it is retained during all the "
"animation. If the pivot point is changed many times, and you want to set it "
"back to its original position, right-click the section in the Stage Schematic "
"and choose **Reset Center** from the menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"截面枢轴点可以移动，但*不能*在动画过程中更改其位置：一旦设置或修改，它将在整个动"
"画过程中保留。如果枢轴点多次更改，并且您想将其设置回原始位置，请在“舞台示意图”中"
"右键单击该部分，然后从打开的菜单中选择**重置中心**。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:55
msgid ""
"The handle refers to the current section; when you link a section to another, "
"the link is graphically displayed connecting the centers of the two sections. "
"When one or several sections are linked, all their links and the related "
"centers, are displayed as well, configuring the skeleton for the model."
msgstr ""
"手柄指当前部分；当您将一个部分链接到另一个部分时，链接将以图形方式显示，连接两个"
"部分的中心。当一个或多个部分链接时，它们的所有链接和相关中心也会显示出来，为模型"
"配置骨架。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:61
msgid "Creating Basic Models"
msgstr "创建基本模型"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:62
msgid ""
"A basic model is made of sections linked to each other by their centers. It's "
"simpler to create if compared to a model based on hooks (see  :ref:`Creating "
"Models with Hooks <creating_models_with_hooks>`  ), and has some limitations, "
"but it is suitable for most of the cases of cutout animation."
msgstr ""
"基本模型由通过中心相互连接的部分组成。与基于钩子的模型相比，它的创建更简单（参"
"见：ref:`使用钩子创建模型<Creating_Models_with_hooks>`），并且有一些局限性，但它"
"适用于大多数剪切动画的情况。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:64
msgid "|basic_model|"
msgstr "|basic_model|"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:66
msgid ""
"By default each section has a *center* that's placed at the center of the "
"viewer. When creating a model, this center has to be moved to where the pivot "
"point for that specific section has to be."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，每个部分都有一个位于查看器中心的*中心*。创建模型时，必须将此中心移动"
"到特定截面的枢轴点所在的位置。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:68
msgid ""
"The **Skeleton** tool (|skeleton|) allows you, both, to change the center "
"position of the currently selected model section, and to link it to the center "
"of another section visible in the Viewer."
msgstr ""
"**骨架**工具（|Skeleton|）允许您更改当前选定模型截面的中心位置，并将其链接到查看"
"器中可见的另一个截面的中心。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:70
msgid ""
"Usually it's simpler to start working from the parent section, then link the "
"other sections one by one, following one limb at a time. For example first set "
"the center of the model trunk, then set the arm pivot point and link the arm to "
"the trunk, then set the forearm pivot point and link the forearm to the arm, "
"then set the hand pivot point and link the hand to the forearm, and so on."
msgstr ""
"通常，从父部分开始工作更简单，然后一个接一个地链接其他部分，一次一个分支。例如，"
"首先设置模型躯干的中心，然后设置手臂枢轴点并将手臂连接到躯干，然后设置前臂枢轴点"
"并把前臂连接到手臂，然后设置手枢轴点并把手连接到前臂，以此类推。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:72
msgid ""
"In case the sections of your model are drawn in the right place, setting the "
"pivot points and the links is all you have to do to define a skeleton. If they "
"are not, you can set the section right position either before or after setting "
"links by using the **Animate** tool or the **Skeleton** tool in **Animate** "
"mode (see  :ref:`Animating Objects <animating_objects>`  and  :ref:`Animating "
"Models <animating_models>`  )."
msgstr ""
"如果模型的截面绘制在正确的位置，则只需设置枢轴点和链接即可定义骨架。如果没有，您"
"可以在设置链接之前或之后，使用**动画**工具或**骨架**工具在**动画**模式下设置节的"
"正确位置（请参见：ref:`动画对象<animation_Objects>'和：ref:'动画模型"
"<animation_Models>'）。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:74
#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:136
msgid "**To select a model section:**"
msgstr "**要选择模型截面，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:76
#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:138
msgid ""
"Select the **Skeleton** tool (|skeleton|), set the mode to **Build Skeleton**, "
"and click the section in the Viewer."
msgstr ""
"选择**骨架**工具（|Skeleton|），将模式设置为**构建骨架**，然后在查看器中单击该部"
"分。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:78
msgid "**To set the pivot point of the selected section:**"
msgstr "**要设置选定截面的枢轴点，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:80
msgid "*Click and drag* the **yellow circle**."
msgstr "*单击并拖动**黄色圆圈**。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:82
msgid "**To Link the selected section to another section:**"
msgstr "**要将所选部分链接到另一个部分，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:84
msgid ""
"*Click and drag* the **square** at the top of the handle to the section you "
"want to be parent. The section you drag to is highlighted by displaying its "
"bounding box and a label displays information about the link you are going to "
"create."
msgstr ""
"*单击并拖动控制柄顶部的**正方形**到要作为父对象的部分。您拖动到的部分将通过显示"
"其边界框来突出显示，标签将显示有关您要创建的链接的信息。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:86
#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:150
msgid "Release to set the link."
msgstr "释放以设置链接。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:88
#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:156
msgid "**To Break the link between the selected section and its parent:**"
msgstr "**要断开所选节与其父节之间的链接，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:90
msgid ""
"*Click and drag* the **square** at the middle of the graphical link between the "
"linked sections away from the parent one."
msgstr "*单击并拖动链接部分之间图形链接中间的**正方形**，使其远离父链接。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:92
#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:160
msgid ""
"**To visualize only the skeleton from the current section up to the parent "
"section:**"
msgstr "**要仅显示从当前部分到父部分的骨架，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:94
#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:162
msgid "Activate the **Show Only Active Skeleton** option in the tool options bar."
msgstr "激活工具选项栏中的**仅显示活动骨架**选项。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:100
msgid "Creating Models with Hooks"
msgstr "使用钩子创建模型"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:101
msgid ""
"Sometimes basic models may not produce the desired results because the "
"positions of the pivot points in the skeleton are fixed, and therefore cannot "
"follow the changes of model sections which are animated levels themselves."
msgstr ""
"有时，基本模型可能无法产生所需的结果，因为骨架中枢轴点的位置是固定的，因此无法跟"
"随作为动画级别本身的模型截面的变化。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:103
msgid "|hook_model_0|"
msgstr "|hook_model_0|"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:105
msgid ""
"For example suppose you have a character whose trunk is an animated level made "
"of several drawings of the trunk bending: as the animation of the trunk goes "
"on, the limbs linked to it will not follow the movement of the trunk (because "
"the trunk is neither moving nor rotating in terms of its transformation values)."
msgstr ""
"例如，假设您有一个角色，其躯干是由躯干弯曲的几个图形组成的动画关卡：随着躯干的动"
"画继续进行，与其链接的肢体将不会跟随躯干的运动（因为躯干在变换值方面既不移动也不"
"旋转）。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:107
msgid "|hook_model_1|"
msgstr "|hook_model_1|"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:109
msgid ""
"By using hooks you can specify, drawing by drawing, where the pivot points have "
"to be placed: in this way the model will maintain its consistency even when "
"different drawings from an animation level are used, during the course of the "
"action (see  :ref:`Using Hooks <using_hooks>`  )."
msgstr ""
"通过使用钩子，您可以逐个绘图指定枢轴点必须放置的位置：这样，即使在动作过程中使用"
"了来自动画级别的不同绘图，模型也会保持一致性（请参阅：ref:`using "
"hooks<using_hooks>`）。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:111
msgid ""
"For example, by placing hooks on the drawings of the trunk and on the limbs "
"(where they have to be connected), and defining the links by using hooks "
"instead of centers, the limbs will follow the trunk even if it is bending."
msgstr ""
"例如，通过在躯干的图纸和四肢（必须连接的地方）上放置钩子，并使用钩子而不是中心来"
"定义链接，即使躯干弯曲，四肢也会跟随躯干。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:113
msgid ""
"The **Skeleton** tool (|skeleton|) allows you, both, to set a hook as the pivot "
"point for the section, and to link it to a specific hook of another section "
"visible in the Viewer."
msgstr ""
"**骨架**工具（|Skeleton|）允许您将钩子设置为截面的枢轴点，并将其链接到查看器中可"
"见的另一个截面的特定钩子。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:115
msgid ""
"Hooks have to be placed for each character model section where you want the "
"joints to be. For example, a trunk may have five hooks, one for the head, two "
"for the arms and two for the legs; a forearm may have two hooks, one for the "
"elbow and one for the wrist."
msgstr ""
"必须为每个角色模型部分放置钩子，在那里你想要关节。例如，一个躯干可能有五个钩子，"
"一个用于头部，两个用于手臂，还有两个用于腿部；前臂可能有两个钩子，一个用于肘部，"
"另一个用于手腕。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:117
msgid ""
"When using the **Hook** tool (|hook|) for defining hooks for the model "
"sections, the **Snap** option can be activated (see :ref:`Using Hooks "
"<using_hooks>`  ). In this way it's possible to place hooks exactly in the same "
"position of hooks already defined for other animation levels visible in the "
"Viewer, or, in case the level is a Toonz Vector level, at the center of closed "
"shapes (e.g. rectangles, circles or single vector shapes closed with the "
"**Tape** tool)."
msgstr ""
"当使用**Hook**工具（|Hook|）为模型部分定义钩子时，可以激活**Snap**选项（请参阅："
"ref:`使用钩子<using_hooks>`）。通过这种方式，可以将钩子精确地放置在查看器中为其"
"他动画级别定义的钩子的相同位置，或者，如果级别是Toanz矢量级别，则可以放置在闭合"
"形状的中心（例如矩形、圆形或用**Tape**工具闭合的单个矢量形状）。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:119
msgid ""
"This means that, in case the model sections are drawn in the right place, you "
"can define perfectly overlapping hooks, so that limbs preserve their position "
"when hooks are linked; or you can use regular shapes in Toonz Vector drawings "
"(such as circles), to define the overlapping areas of the model limbs, and "
"consequently place hooks exactly at their center to achieve a perfect match "
"when hooks are linked."
msgstr ""
"这意味着，如果模型剖面绘制在正确的位置，您可以定义完全重叠的钩子，这样当钩子链接"
"时，肢体可以保持其位置；或者，您可以在Toanz Vector图形中使用规则形状（如圆形）来"
"定义模型肢体的重叠区域，从而将钩子精确地放置在它们的中心，以便在钩子链接时实现完"
"美匹配。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:121
msgid ""
"The hook number is just a label to identify hooks, and it is not relevant when "
"performing links."
msgstr "钩子编号只是用于标识钩子的标签，在执行链接时与此无关。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:123
msgid ""
"Usually it's simpler to start working from the parent section, then link the "
"other sections one by one, following one limb at the time."
msgstr ""
"通常，从父部分开始工作更简单，然后一个接一个地链接其他部分，一次链接一个分支。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:125
msgid ""
"When starting to build a skeleton with hooks, two different cases may take "
"place: the model sections are not drawn in the right place, one in relation to "
"another; or they are drawn in the right place one in relation to another."
msgstr ""
"当开始构建带有钩子的骨架时，可能会出现两种不同的情况：模型截面没有绘制在正确的位"
"置，一个相对于另一个；或者它们被绘制在正确的位置，一个相对于另一个。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:127
msgid "|hook_model_2|"
msgstr "|hook_model_2|"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:129
msgid ""
"In the first case the appropriate hook has first to be set as the pivot point "
"for the model section, then the link can be created. Note that when setting a "
"hook as the new pivot point, the hook, and consequently the section, *shifts* "
"to the center of the work area; as soon as you link that section to the hook of "
"another section, it goes to the right place, with the two hooks perfectly "
"overlapping."
msgstr ""
"在第一种情况下，必须首先将适当的钩子设置为模型截面的枢轴点，然后才能创建链接。请"
"注意，当将钩子设置为新的枢轴点时，钩子以及相应的截面会*移动*到工作区域的中心；一"
"旦你将该部分链接到另一部分的钩子，它就会到达正确的位置，两个钩子完全重叠。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:131
msgid ""
"In the second case a hook of the selected section and a hook of another section "
"are overlapping (e.g. the hook on the wrist of the hand section overlaps the "
"hook on the wrist of the forearm section), and a special button displaying "
"information about the overlapping hooks can be used to automatically link the "
"two sections with a single click."
msgstr ""
"在第二种情况下，所选部分的钩子和另一部分的钩子重叠（例如，手部手腕上的钩子与前臂"
"部分手腕上的钩重叠），并且可以使用显示有关重叠钩子信息的特殊按钮通过单击自动链接"
"这两个部分。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:133
msgid "|hook_model_3|"
msgstr "|hook_model_3|"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:140
msgid "**To set a hook as the pivot point of the selected section:**"
msgstr "**要将钩子设置为选定截面的枢轴点，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:142
msgid "Click the hook label displayed close to the hook."
msgstr "单击钩子附近显示的钩子标签。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:144
msgid "**To Link the selected section to a hook another section:**"
msgstr "**要将所选部分链接到另一个部分，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:146
msgid ""
"*Click and drag* the square at the top of the handle up to the section you want "
"to be its parent. All the *hooks* are displayed and the section you drag to is "
"highlighted by displaying its bounding box."
msgstr ""
"*单击并拖动*控制柄顶部的正方形，直到要作为其父级的部分。将显示所有*挂钩*，并通过"
"显示其边界框突出显示您拖动到的部分。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:148
msgid ""
"Drag towards the hook you want to link the section to: the hook label is "
"displayed and another label displays information about the link you are going "
"to create."
msgstr ""
"向要链接该部分的钩子拖动：将显示钩子标签，另一个标签显示有关要创建的链接的信息。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:152
msgid "**To Link two overlapping hooks:**"
msgstr "**要链接两个重叠的挂钩，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:154
msgid ""
"Click the label close to the overlapping hooks displaying information about the "
"link you are going to create."
msgstr "单击重叠挂钩附近的标签，显示有关要创建的链接的信息。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:158
msgid ""
"*Click and drag* the square at the middle of the graphical link between the "
"linked sections away from the parent one."
msgstr "*单击并拖动*链接部分之间图形链接中间的正方形，使其远离父链接。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:168
msgid "Animating Models"
msgstr "为模型制作动画"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:169
msgid ""
"When the Skeleton tool (|skeleton|) mode is set to **Animate**, it is possible "
"to set positions for the model sections at different frames, thus defining an "
"animation."
msgstr ""
"当骨架工具（|Skeleton|）模式设置为**动画**时，可以为不同帧的模型部分设置位置，从"
"而定义动画。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:171
msgid ""
"In the viewer it's possible to select a model section and perform the following "
"tasks:"
msgstr "在查看器中，可以选择一个模型部分并执行以下任务："

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:173
msgid "*Click anywhere* to rotate the current section."
msgstr "*单击任意位置*以旋转当前部分。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:175
msgid ""
"*Click and drag the green square with the four arrows* to move the current "
"section."
msgstr "*单击并拖动带有四个箭头*的绿色正方形以移动当前部分。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:177
msgid ""
"As you roll over the handle, the cursor changes shape to indicate to you the "
"operations you may perform."
msgstr "当您滚动控制柄时，光标会改变形状，以指示您可以执行的操作。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:179
msgid ""
"Every time a position for a section is set, a keyframe is automatically "
"generated for the Xsheet column (or Timeline layer) where that section is "
"exposed, at the current frame. Keys are created only for the transformation you "
"modify: rotation, displacement, or both."
msgstr ""
"每次设置截面的位置时，都会在当前帧处为暴露该截面的Xsheet列（或时间线层）自动生成"
"关键帧。仅为您修改的变换（旋转、位移或两者）创建关键帧。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:181
msgid ""
"It is also possible to activate the **Global Key** option in order to set a "
"keyframe for all the section transformations, including scaling and shearing, "
"as soon as a keyframe for one transformation is set. This may result useful if "
"you want to animate the model first, and then refine the animation by adding "
"stretching and squashing transformations."
msgstr ""
"也可以激活**全局关键点**选项，以便在为一个变换设置关键帧后，立即为所有截面变换"
"（包括缩放和剪切）设置关键帧。如果您想先为模型设置动画，然后通过添加拉伸和挤压变"
"换来细化动画，这可能会很有用。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:183
msgid ""
"If you want to create a keyframe without operating the handle, in order to "
"leave the section position and rotation as they are, you can use the **Set "
"Key** button (|key|) available in the bottom bar of the Viewer. In this case "
"keys are created for all the object transformations (see :ref:`Animating "
"Objects <animating_objects>`  ). It is also possible to manage keys for several "
"model sections at once by inserting or deleting keys affecting the Xsheet/"
"Timeline as a whole, or a selection of Xsheet columns (or Timeline layers) "
"(see :ref:`Working with Multiple Column Keys "
"<working_with_multiple_column_keys>`  )."
msgstr ""
"如果要在不操作控制柄的情况下创建关键帧，以便保持截面位置和旋转不变，可以使用查看"
"器底部栏中的**设置关键帧**按钮（|Key|）。在这种情况下，将为所有对象变换创建关键"
"帧（请参见：ref:`为对象设置动画<animation_Objects>`）。还可以通过插入或删除影响"
"整个Xsheet/Timeline的键，或选择Xsheet列（或Timeline层）来同时管理多个模型部分的"
"键（请参阅：ref:`使用多列键<Working_with_Multiple_Column_keys>`）。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:185
msgid ""
"Keys and interpolations you define in this way are displayed in Xsheet columns "
"(or Timeline layers), where they can be directly managed (see  :ref:`Using "
"Column Keys <using_column_keys>`  )."
msgstr ""
"您以这种方式定义的键和插值显示在Xsheet列（或时间线层）中，可以直接管理它们（请参"
"阅：ref:`使用列键<Using_Column_Keys>`）。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:187
msgid ""
"As keyframes can be defined at specific frames for specific sections only, you "
"may calibrate the animation and the movement speed of your model the way you "
"prefer."
msgstr ""
"由于关键帧只能在特定部分的特定帧处定义，因此您可以按照自己喜欢的方式校准动画和模"
"型的移动速度。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:189
msgid ""
"Columns/layers can also be animated by working in the Function Editor (see  :"
"ref:`Editing Using Spreadsheet and Curves "
"<editing_curves_and_numerical_columns>`  )"
msgstr ""
"列/层也可以通过在函数编辑器中工作来设置动画（请参阅：ref:“使用电子表格和曲线编辑"
"<Editing_Curves_and_numerical_Columns>”）"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:191
msgid ""
"In case a model section is an animation level consisting of several drawings "
"instead of a single one (for example, if the character’s hand is an animation "
"level consisting of drawings of the hand in different positions), the "
"**Skeleton** tool (|skeleton|) lets you also flip through the drawings to "
"choose the one you need."
msgstr ""
"如果模型部分是由多个图形而不是单个图形组成的动画级别（例如，如果角色的手是由不同"
"位置的手的图形组成的动画片级），则**骨架**工具（|Skeleton|）还允许您翻转图形以选"
"择所需的图形。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:193
msgid "**To Select a model section:**"
msgstr "**要选择模型截面，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:195
msgid ""
"Choose the **Skeleton** tool (|skeleton|), set the mode to **Animate**, and "
"click the section in the Viewer."
msgstr ""
"选择**骨架**工具（|Skeleton|），将模式设置为**动画**，然后在查看器中单击该部分。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:197
msgid "**To Rotate the selected section:**"
msgstr "**要旋转选定部分，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:199
msgid "Click and drag *anywhere* in the Viewer."
msgstr "在查看器中单击并拖动*任意位置*。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:201
msgid "**To Move the selected section:**"
msgstr "**要移动所选部分，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:203
msgid ""
"Click and drag *the green square with the four arrows* available on the right "
"of the current section pivot point."
msgstr "单击并拖动当前截面枢轴点右侧带有四个箭头的绿色正方形。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:205
msgid ""
"**To visualize only the pivot points of the current section up to the parent "
"section:**"
msgstr "**要仅显示当前截面到父截面的枢轴点，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:207
msgid ""
"Activate the **Show Only Active Skeleton** option in the Skeleton tool options "
"bar."
msgstr "激活骨架工具选项栏中的**仅显示活动骨架**选项。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:209
msgid "**To flip through the drawings belonging to the animation level:**"
msgstr "**要翻转属于动画级别的图形，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:211
msgid ""
"Click *the label with the level name* on the right of the current section pivot "
"point and flip through following and previous frames by doing one of the "
"following:"
msgstr ""
"单击当前截面枢轴点右侧带有标高名称*的标签，并通过执行以下操作之一翻转以下帧和上"
"一帧："

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:213
msgid "Drag up or down."
msgstr "向上或向下拖动。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:215
msgid "Click the up or down arrowheads."
msgstr "单击向上或向下箭头。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:221
msgid "Using Inverse Kinematics"
msgstr "使用反向运动学"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:222
msgid ""
"When the **Skeleton** tool (|skeleton|) mode is set to **Inverse Kinematics**, "
"it's possible to move the model considering the articulation of all the "
"sections its skeleton is made of. This means that if you want to move the end "
"of a model limb to a particular position, all the rest of the sections "
"belonging to that limb will move consequently, with no need to move each "
"section separately."
msgstr ""
"当**骨架**工具（|Skeleton|）模式设置为**反向运动学**时，可以考虑其骨架所组成的所"
"有部分的关节来移动模型。这意味着，如果要将模型肢体的末端移动到特定位置，则属于该"
"肢体的所有其他部分都将随之移动，而不需要单独移动每个部分。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:224
msgid ""
"For example, if you want the hand of a character to reach a particular point, "
"you don’t need to animate the arm and the forearm separately, but instead you "
"can move the hand to the final position, automatically adjusting the arm and "
"forearm sections."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果希望角色的手到达特定点，则不需要分别设置手臂和前臂的动画，而是可以将手"
"移动到最终位置，自动调整手臂和前臂部分。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:226
msgid "|inverse_kinematics|"
msgstr "|inverse_kinematics|"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:228
msgid ""
"When the **Inverse Kinematics** mode is activated, the full skeleton with pivot "
"points and links is displayed."
msgstr "当激活**反向运动学**模式时，将显示具有枢轴点和链接的完整骨架。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:230
msgid ""
"When moving the model, a rotation keyframe is automatically defined for all the "
"sections involved in the movement, unless the **Global Key** option is "
"activated thus generating a keyframe for all the section transformations."
msgstr ""
"移动模型时，会自动为移动中涉及的所有截面定义旋转关键帧，除非激活了**全局关键点**"
"选项，从而为所有截面变换生成关键帧。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:232
msgid ""
"When using inverse kinematics the movements of the parent section of the "
"skeleton are automatically computed to allow the right configuration of the "
"skeleton; this means that they *cannot* be edited anymore by using standard "
"movement editing tools like the **Animate** tool or the **Function Editor**. To "
"return to the standard movement editing mode, you have to reset the pinned "
"centers information."
msgstr ""
"使用反向运动学时，会自动计算骨架父部分的运动，以允许骨架的正确配置；这意味着它们"
"不能再使用**动画**工具或**函数编辑器**等标准运动编辑工具进行编辑。要返回标准移动"
"编辑模式，您必须重置固定中心信息。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:236
msgid "Pinned Center"
msgstr "钉扎中心"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:237
msgid ""
"One single center (by default located on the section that is the parent of the "
"skeleton), is displayed as a **blue square**: indicating that it's **pinned** "
"and its position won't change throughout the animation when the character "
"sections are animated."
msgstr ""
"一个中心（默认位于骨架的父部分上）显示为**蓝色正方形**：表示它被**固定**，并且当"
"角色部分被设置动画时，它的位置在整个动画过程中不会改变。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:239
msgid ""
"The **pinned center** can be moved from a joint to another along the animation "
"in order to have a center pinned only for a specific frame range. When the "
"pinned center is changed at a specific frame, all the previous frames will "
"retain the **previously pinned center**; all the following frames will have the "
"**new pinned center** up to the frame where another pinned center position, if "
"any, is defined in advance."
msgstr ""
"**固定中心**可以沿着动画从一个关节移动到另一个关节，以便仅在特定帧范围内固定中"
"心。当在特定帧处更改固定中心时，所有先前帧将保留**先前固定的中心**；所有后续帧都"
"将具有**新的固定中心**，直到帧中预先定义了另一个固定中心位置（如果有的话）。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:241
msgid ""
"Changing the pinned center allows for a more complex animation where fixed "
"points have to change while the model is moving, for example a walk where one "
"ankle is pinned while the character is doing the first step, and the other "
"ankle is pinned during the second step."
msgstr ""
"更改固定中心允许更复杂的动画，其中固定点必须在模型移动时更改，例如，在角色执行第"
"一步时固定一个脚踝，在第二步中固定另一个脚踝的行走。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:243
msgid ""
"Once the *pinned center* is defined, it will remain active when animating "
"skeleton sections both with the **Skeleton** tool (|skeleton|), and with the "
"**Animate** tool (|animate|). To freely animate any skeleton section again, "
"reset the pinned center information (see below)."
msgstr ""
"一旦定义了*固定中心*，当使用**骨架**工具（|skeleton|）和**动画**工具（|动画|）为"
"骨架部分设置动画时，它将保持活动状态。要再次自由设置任何骨架部分的动画，请重置固"
"定中心信息（见下文）。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:246
msgid "Temporarily Pinned Centers"
msgstr "临时固定中心"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:247
msgid ""
"Multiple additional centers can be *temporarily pinned* at any frame in order "
"to constrain additional joints to a specific position. Unlike the pinned "
"center, **temporarily pinned centers** are *not* preserved when the current "
"frame changes, as they are used only to define the position of the sections at "
"a certain frame."
msgstr ""
"多个附加中心可以*临时固定*在任何帧上，以便将附加关节约束到特定位置。与固定中心不"
"同，**临时固定中心**在当前帧更改时不会保留，因为它们仅用于定义特定帧处截面的位"
"置。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:249
msgid ""
"Using **temporarily pinned centers** allows for the definition of specific "
"poses at specific frames, for example the rising of an arm by pinning the "
"shoulder joint."
msgstr ""
"使用**临时固定中心**可以定义特定帧的特定姿势，例如通过固定肩关节来抬起手臂。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:251
msgid ""
"According to the *pinned center*, and the *temporarily pinned centers*, it's "
"possible to click any point of any section and drag to move the model: all the "
"parent sections up to the *first pinned center* along the skeleton will move "
"consequently, while all the linked sections *down to the free end of the limb* "
"will move rigidly with the picked section. The sections affected by the "
"movement are highlighted by displaying the link wires in *red*."
msgstr ""
"根据*固定中心*和*临时固定中心*，可以单击任何截面的任何点并拖动以移动模型：沿着骨"
"架向上移动到*第一个固定中心*的所有父截面将随之移动，而向下移动到肢体自由端*的所"
"有链接截面将与拾取的截面一起刚性移动。受移动影响的部分通过以*红色*显示链接线来突"
"出显示。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:253
msgid ""
"The pinned centers information and coordinates are saved along with the scene; "
"in case you want to delete it or start the animation by using the inverse "
"kinematics from scratch, this information can be reset to the default, where "
"only the center of the parent section of the skeleton is pinned."
msgstr ""
"固定的中心信息和坐标与场景一起保存；如果要删除它或从头开始使用反向运动学启动动"
"画，则可以将此信息重置为默认值，即仅固定骨架父部分的中心。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:255
msgid "**To animate the model with Inverse Kinematics:**"
msgstr "**要使用反向运动学为模型设置动画，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:257
msgid ""
"Choose the **Skeleton** tool (|skeleton|) and set the mode to **Inverse "
"Kinematics**."
msgstr "选择**骨架**工具（|Skeleton|）并将模式设置为**反向运动学**。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:259
msgid "Click any point of any model section and drag it to the desired position."
msgstr "单击任何模型截面的任意点并将其拖动到所需位置。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:261
msgid "**To set the skeleton Pinned Center:**"
msgstr "**要设置骨架“固定中心”，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:263
msgid ""
"**Click the center**: it turns from an *orange circle* to a *blue square* to "
"indicate it is **pinned**."
msgstr "**点击中心**：它从*橙色圆圈*变成*蓝色正方形*，表示它被**固定**。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:265
msgid "**To change the skeleton Pinned Center:**"
msgstr "**要更改骨架“固定中心”，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:267
msgid "Select the frame where you want the new center to be set."
msgstr "选择要设置新中心的帧。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:269
msgid ""
"**Click the center**: all the previous frames will retain the *previously "
"pinned center*; all the following frames will have the *new pinned center* up "
"to a frame where another pinned position might have been defined in advance."
msgstr ""
"**点击中心**：所有之前的帧将保留*之前固定的中心*；所有后续帧都将具有“新的固定中"
"心”，直到可能预先定义了另一个固定位置的帧。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:271
msgid "**To set a Temporarily Pinned Center:**"
msgstr "**要设置临时固定中心，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:273
msgid ""
"**Shift-click the center**: it turns from an *orange circle* to a *light blue "
"square* to indicate it is **temporarily pinned**."
msgstr ""
"**按住Shift键并单击中心**：它从*橙色圆圈*变为*浅蓝色正方形*，表示它被**暂时固定"
"**。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:275
msgid "**To unset a Temporarily Pinned Center:**"
msgstr "**要取消设置临时固定中心，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:277
msgid ""
"**Shift-click the temporarily pinned center**: it turns from a *light blue "
"square* to an *orange circle* to indicate it's no longer temporarily pinned."
msgstr ""
"**按住Shift键并单击临时固定的中心**：它将从*浅蓝色正方形*变为*橙色圆圈*，表示它"
"不再临时固定。"

#: ../../source/creating_cutout_animation.rst:279
msgid "**To Reset the Pinned Centers information:**"
msgstr "**要重置固定中心信息，请执行以下操作：**"

